			'The Lord’s Prayer is the prayer Jesus taught His followers when they asked Him how to pray. It begins “Our Father in heaven” and asks that His name be honoured as holy, His kingdom come and His will be done, and that He give us our daily bread, forgive us as we forgive others, and keep us from temptation and the evil one. It is recorded in Matthew 6:9-13 and Luke 11:2-4.',
