			'In the Bible, the prayer in Matthew ends with “deliver us from the evil one.” The closing line, “For thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory, for ever. Amen,” is not in the earliest manuscripts; it came into the prayer from the early church’s worship. Many churches still pray it, and you are free to.',
	},
